WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:16.267
Zann's mind whirled as he finally got up to follow Venna.

2
00:00:16.268 --> 00:00:20.507
For a moment he thought he'd lost her—he couldn't hear or see her anywhere.

3
00:00:20.508 --> 00:00:24.054
Then he heard the soft clang of the airship door opening.

4
00:00:24.055 --> 00:00:27.836
As he neared the airship, Zann saw that the door was standing open.

5
00:00:27.837 --> 00:00:32.422
He crept closer and peered in. Venna was inside with her back to him.

6
00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:35.861
She was pulling things out of a box. The relics!

7
00:00:35.862 --> 00:00:39.150
Zann watched as Venna gathered them into a large sack.

8
00:00:39.151 --> 00:00:46.365
He recognized a few of the relics—the Horn of the Otherworld, a scary-looking skull mask he guessed was the Mask of Zanta,

9
00:00:46.366 --> 00:00:49.041
and several others he'd studied in school.

10
00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:55.544
"Wow," he whispered. His teachers said the Horn alone held enough power to control all of Magica!

11
00:00:55.545 --> 00:00:59.807
Venna slung the sack over her shoulder and then hurried toward the Cave.

12
00:00:59.808 --> 00:01:05.759
Zann wasn't sure what to do. It seemed Venna was planning to take the relics through the wormhole herself.

13
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:09.013
If Zann followed her, she'd lead him to the wormhole.

14
00:01:09.014 --> 00:01:12.401
He could hide until she went through it and then jump through.

15
00:01:12.402 --> 00:01:15.376
He'd be on his way to search for his parents within minutes.

16
00:01:15.377 --> 00:01:20.876
But if he did that, he wouldn't have time to leave a message for Boz or his friends about Venna's plan.

17
00:01:20.877 --> 00:01:27.622
And what if Tok was right? What if the wormhole was too unstable to handle all those powerful relics passing through it?

18
00:01:27.623 --> 00:01:32.030
What if Venna accidentally blew up the entire cave and everyone nearby?

19
00:01:32.031 --> 00:01:34.488
"Oh, man," Zann muttered.

20
00:01:34.489 --> 00:01:39.172
He had to warn Boz and the others. It was the only responsible thing to do.

21
00:01:39.173 --> 00:01:42.890
Zann turned and sprinted toward camp.

22
00:01:42.891 --> 00:01:46.345
"Are we there yet?" Perda wondered breathlessly.

23
00:01:46.346 --> 00:01:51.317
Zann and his friends were racing through a narrow tunnel behind Boz, Teplo, and several others.

24
00:01:51.318 --> 00:01:54.834
Magic energy was bouncing off the walls all around them.

25
00:01:54.835 --> 00:01:59.378
Despite the risks, the Magic Masters were using magic to lead them to Venna.

26
00:01:59.379 --> 00:02:02.673
Otherwise they were afraid they'd be too late to stop her.

27
00:02:02.674 --> 00:02:06.783
"Venna!" Uncle Gar shouted. "Where are you?"

28
00:02:06.784 --> 00:02:12.326
There was no answer. "This way," Boz said grimly, taking off down another tunnel.

29
00:02:12.327 --> 00:02:18.349
Zann's crawler squeaked a warning, and Zann ducked just in time to avoid a burst of energy.

30
00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:21.276
"Close one," Gliss exclaimed behind him.

31
00:02:21.277 --> 00:02:23.274
Zann nodded and kept going.

32
00:02:23.275 --> 00:02:26.078
They ran through one tunnel after another.

33
00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:32.897
Finally they all burst into a huge chamber dripping with stalactites. In the center stood Venna.

34
00:02:32.898 --> 00:02:37.558
"Stop!" Boz cried. "Venna, this is madness!"

35
00:02:37.559 --> 00:02:40.801
Venna glanced over her shoulder, looking surprised.

36
00:02:40.802 --> 00:02:46.193
"I don't care how risky it is," she cried. "I'm doing this for Magica!"

37
00:02:46.194 --> 00:02:50.932
Zann watched as Venna stepped forward and the wormhole swirled open.

38
00:02:50.933 --> 00:02:54.724
The edges flashed with silvery bursts of energy.

39
00:02:54.725 --> 00:02:57.858
"Douse!" Boz cried, rubbing his hands.

40
00:02:57.859 --> 00:03:01.170
"No!" Venna froze as the spell hit her.

41
00:03:01.171 --> 00:03:03.908
Without magic she couldn't go into the wormhole.

42
00:03:03.909 --> 00:03:07.185
She needed magic to navigate through the vortex.

43
00:03:07.186 --> 00:03:12.366
"This is an outrage!" Venna ranted. "You can't douse me!"

44
00:03:12.367 --> 00:03:16.696
"We'll remove the spell after you've listened to us," Teplo said.

45
00:03:16.697 --> 00:03:21.340
"I swear it. The final decision on what to do is yours."

46
00:03:21.341 --> 00:03:27.242
Venna scowled. "Fine. Say your piece. My mind is made up."

47
00:03:27.243 --> 00:03:31.764
"I don't think you comprehend the true risks," Boz said.

48
00:03:31.765 --> 00:03:35.698
"Those relics contain a stupendous amount of energy.

49
00:03:35.699 --> 00:03:43.131
Trying to take even one of them through this particular wormhole is a dangerous proposition. Taking them all—"

50
00:03:43.132 --> 00:03:46.787
"You could blow us to bits!" Uncle Gar finished.

51
00:03:46.788 --> 00:03:50.872
Venna blinked. "I . . . I never thought about that.

52
00:03:50.873 --> 00:03:54.627
But I can't let you seal off these relics forever.

53
00:03:54.628 --> 00:03:59.891
Magica must be able to defend itself. I'm doing this for all of us."

54
00:03:59.892 --> 00:04:01.756
Teplo held out a hand to her.

55
00:04:01.757 --> 00:04:06.306
"If you feel that strongly, perhaps we can reopen the discussion.

56
00:04:06.307 --> 00:04:10.364
I won't speak for the others, but I'll listen to your arguments."

57
00:04:10.365 --> 00:04:13.915
"Me too," Boz said. The others nodded.

58
00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:18.447
Venna peered at them all suspiciously. Finally her expression softened.

59
00:04:18.448 --> 00:04:22.494
"All right. You have a deal." She handed the sack to Teplo.

60
00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:27.139
"Thank you." Teplo smiled at her and then pulled out the Horn of the Otherworld.

61
00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:30.606
"Magnificent," he murmured. He glanced at Boz.

62
00:04:30.607 --> 00:04:34.183
"Don't forget to remove the Dousing spell. Carefully."

63
00:04:34.184 --> 00:04:37.575
"Oh, yes." Boz rubbed his fingers together.

64
00:04:37.576 --> 00:04:41.654
At that moment all the crawlers let out a loud chirp.

65
00:04:41.655 --> 00:04:44.357
"Careful!" Perda blurted out.

66
00:04:44.358 --> 00:04:50.750
Friction sparked around Boz's fingers. A bolt of energy shot straight at the Horn of the Otherworld.

67
00:04:50.751 --> 00:04:53.778
The relic glowed and shuddered in Teplo's hand.

68
00:04:53.779 --> 00:04:56.002
"Duck!" Teplo shouted.

69
00:04:56.003 --> 00:04:59.839
Zann pressed himself against the wall as sparks shot from the horn.

70
00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:04.213
The wormhole glowed more brightly, and a tentacle of energy shot out.

71
00:05:04.214 --> 00:05:07.333
Venna screamed as the energy surrounded her.

72
00:05:07.334 --> 00:05:13.273
A second later the wormhole pulled her in, her scream still echoing off the chamber's walls.

73
00:05:13.274 --> 00:05:16.689
"Venna!" Boz cried, but it was too late.

74
00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:23.345
"Oh no!" Perda's face was white. "She was still under the Dousing spell!"

75
00:05:23.346 --> 00:05:29.924
There was an ominous rumble. Chunks of stone rained down, and the entire chamber shook.

76
00:05:29.925 --> 00:05:35.750
Tok gulped. "I think we just destabilized the Cave. Everybody run!"

77
00:05:35.751 --> 00:05:42.298
"Too late!" Teplo dropped the sack of relics and grabbed Perda's hand. "Join hands—quickly!"

78
00:05:42.299 --> 00:05:46.821
A small stalactite dropped and shattered at Zann's feet.

79
00:05:46.822 --> 00:05:50.131
"Hurry!" he shouted, grabbing Darb and Zing.

80
00:05:50.132 --> 00:05:52.870
Soon the entire group was holding hands.

81
00:05:52.871 --> 00:05:57.077
"Zap!" shouted all the Magic Masters in unison.

82
00:05:57.078 --> 00:06:03.252
Zann landed near the camp with the others just in time to see the entire cave collapse into a heap of rubble.

83
00:06:03.253 --> 00:06:06.276
He ducked as a stray bolt of energy shot over them.

84
00:06:06.277 --> 00:06:08.958
At first all he felt was relief.

85
00:06:08.959 --> 00:06:12.502
Then his heart sank as he realized what this meant.

86
00:06:12.503 --> 00:06:19.506
He'd just lost another chance to search for his parents.
